Supervised tweaking places user input and desired assistant responses in the `messages` array of format chat completions. When learning a tool call, place `tool_calls` in the assistant message and include the definition `tools`.

```
{"messages": [
  {"role": "user", "content": "What is the refund deadline?"},
  {"role": "assistant", "content": "You can apply within 7 days of purchase."}
]}
```
